| `firmware/App/app/menu.c` `.h`, `app/action.c` `.h`, `app/common.h`, `app/generic.h`, `app/scanner.h`, `ui/battery.h`, `ui/welcome.h`, `driver/eeprom.h` | verbatim | the tables and headers the screens compile against |
| `firmware/App/version.c` `.h`, `App/dcs.c`, `App/frequencies.c`, `App/helper/battery.c` | verbatim | version strings, the CTCSS/DCS tables the menu indexes, the step/band tables, the battery arithmetic.  Their hardware calls (ADC, flash) are not reached by the screens yet |
| `firmware/App/ui/menu.h`, `ui/ui.h`, `ui/helper.c` `.h`, `ui/inputbox.c` `.h` | verbatim | menu table declarations, the screen dispatcher's interface, drawing/text helpers |
